      "note": "The dark edge is a highlight, not a contour: a translucent white ring reads as the top light catching a chamfer and composites over whatever fill it lands on, where an opaque colour has to be re-picked per surface. The three dark rungs are that one highlight at .09, .18 and .30; the light rungs stay the warm opaque ladder, since on a light canvas an edge is a shadow.",
